<Defs>
	<ThingDef ParentName="TreeBase">
		<defName>AB_GoldenCubeTree</defName>
		<label>golden cube tree</label>
		<description>These rare trees grow giant, shimmering golden cubes in place of fruit. Their trunks are smooth and warm, radiating a gentle comfort. When the wind rustles their leaves, the cubes chime softly, like distant laughter. Though they offer no practical boon beyond wood and gold, standing beneath one feels inexplicably reassuring.\n\nPlant details: Golden cube trees are wild plants, and they need minimum terrain fertility of 0.7. Can be harvested for wood and gold.\n\nBased on art by Sofia da Silva https://fisilva.artstation.com/projects/bkaDn</description>
		<descriptionHyperlinks>
			<ThingDef>WoodLog</ThingDef>
			<ThingDef>Gold</ThingDef>
		</descriptionHyperlinks>
		<graphicData>
			<texPath>Things/Plants/AB_CubeTree</texPath>
			<graphicClass>Graphic_Random</graphicClass>
			<shadowData>
				<volume>(0.18, 0.3, 0.15)</volume>
			</shadowData>
		</graphicData>
		<altitudeLayer>BuildingOnTop</altitudeLayer>
		<statBases>
			<Beauty>2</Beauty>
			<BeautyOutdoors>2</BeautyOutdoors>
			<Nutrition>1.2</Nutrition>
		</statBases>
		<plant>
			<growDays>14</growDays>
			<harvestWork>550</harvestWork>
			<harvestYield>25</harvestYield>
			<wildClusterRadius>10</wildClusterRadius>
			<wildClusterWeight>11</wildClusterWeight>
			<visualSizeRange>2.8~3.8</visualSizeRange>
			<choppedThingDef IsNull="True"/>
			<smashedThingDef IsNull="True"/>
		</plant>
		<ingestible/>
		<modExtensions>
			<li Class="VEF.Plants.DualCropExtension">
				<secondaryOutput>Gold</secondaryOutput>
				<outPutAmount>10</outPutAmount>
			</li>
		</modExtensions>
	</ThingDef>
	<ThingDef ParentName="TreeBase">
		<defName>AB_TechnoTree</defName>
		<label>techno tree</label>
		<description>A bizarre fusion of bark and circuitry, this half-synthetic tree hums with low energy pulses. It grows like a plant, but responds like a machine. Small amounts of circuitry can be extracted from them, making industrial-grade components a renewable resource in this region.\n\nPlant details: Techno trees are wild plants, and they need minimum terrain fertility of 0.7. Can be harvested for wood and components.\n\nInspired by art by Prajwal K Kumar https://www.artstation.com/prajwalkkumar</description>
		<descriptionHyperlinks>
			<ThingDef>WoodLog</ThingDef>
			<ThingDef>ComponentIndustrial</ThingDef>
		</descriptionHyperlinks>
