	<ThingDef ParentName="TreeBase">
		<defName>AB_LuminescentTree</defName>
		<label>luminescent tree</label>
		<description>A tree-like giant bramble that supports a huge globe of glowing sap that casts a soft, colorful light in the dark. Its branches cradle the orb like a lantern, and the liquid inside gently swirls with bioluminescent energy.\n\nPlant details: Luminescent trees are wild plants, and they need minimum terrain fertility of 0.7. Can be harvested for wood.\n\nInspired by art by Prajwal K Kumar https://www.artstation.com/prajwalkkumar</description>
