	<ThingDef ParentName="TreeBase">
		<defName>AB_CalcifiedRemnant</defName>
		<label>calcified remnant</label>
		<description>Half-alive, half-dead, this plant seems to be partly organic and partly inorganic. Its living tissues persist within a greenish shell of mineralized growth, slowly replacing stems, leaves, and roots with stone-like structures. Yet beneath the calcified exterior, faint signs of life remain.\n\nPlant details: Calcified remnants are wild plants, and they need minimum terrain fertility of 0.7. Can be harvested for minute amounts of wood and random stone chunks.\n\nInspired by No Man's Sky.</description>
		<descriptionHyperlinks>
			<ThingDef>WoodLog</ThingDef>
		</descriptionHyperlinks>
		<graphicData>
			<texPath>Things/Plants/AB_CalcifiedRemnant</texPath>
			<graphicClass>Graphic_Random</graphicClass>
			<shadowData>
				<volume>(0.2, 0.3, 0.13)</volume>
				<offset>(0,0,-0.44)</offset>
