					<li>ChunkGranite</li>
					<li>ChunkLimestone</li>
					<li>ChunkSlate</li>
					<li>ChunkMarble</li>
				</randomSecondaryOutput>
			</li>
		</modExtensions>
	</ThingDef>
	<ThingDef ParentName="TreeBase">
		<defName>AB_LivingAlcyonite</defName>
		<label>living alcyonite</label>
		<description>This crystalline organism grows and pulses with faint signs of life, its mineral body constantly shifting and regenerating. They were originally created as a bioengineered solution to alcyonite mining, but inevitably spread into the wild.\n\nPlant details: Living alcyonite are wild "plants", and they need minimum terrain fertility of 0.7. Can be harvested for alcyonite chunks.\n\nInspired by No Man's Sky.</description>
		<descriptionHyperlinks>
			<ThingDef>AB_AlcyoniteChunk</ThingDef>
		</descriptionHyperlinks>
		<graphicData>
			<texPath>Things/Plants/AB_LivingAlcyonite</texPath>
