	<ThingDef ParentName="TreeBase">
		<defName>AB_Tooth</defName>
		<label>giant false tooth</label>
		<description>These otherworldly plants grow within hollow marble lattices shaped like enormous teeth, using the casing for support and protection as their roots spread beneath the sands. A bizarre creation of an insane geneticist, their name and origins long lost to the centuries.\n\nPlant details: Giant false teeth are wild plants, and they need minimum terrain fertility of 0.1. Can be harvested for marble blocks and a bit of ancient bone.</description>
